Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: keepa-fixture
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Synthetic evidence-wiki provider plugin used only by this repository's test suite.
Author: EvidenceWiki contributors
License: MIT
Requires-Python: >=3.10

Registers one acquisition provider (``keepa-fixture``) and one discovery provider
(``keepa-search-fixture``) under the evidence-wiki entry-point groups. It plans HTTPS
requests against reserved ``.invalid`` hosts and never performs I/O of its own.
